    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tome is an <strong>Action RPG Dungeon Crawler</strong>\u00a0with<strong> Survivors-Like Combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and refine your own set of <strong>game-breaking synergies</strong>\u00a0with an expansive character progression system. Collect and craft powerful items as you explore an endless Atlas of Maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compose<strong>\u00a0</strong>gems<strong>\u00a0</strong>in your <strong>Tome</strong>\u00a0to create innovative skill combinations in a novel building mechanic inspired by <strong>Sudoku</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>high-octane, 0-button build action</strong> with procedurally-generated levels and items, in a unique hybrid 2D-3D art style.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tome is an <strong>Action RPG Dungeon Crawler</strong>\u00a0with<strong> Survivors-Like Combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and refine your own set of <strong>game-breaking synergies</strong>\u00a0with an expansive character progression system. Collect and craft powerful items as you explore an endless Atlas of Maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compose<strong>\u00a0</strong>gems<strong>\u00a0</strong>in your <strong>Tome</strong>\u00a0to create innovative skill combinations in a novel building mechanic inspired by <strong>Sudoku</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>high-octane, 0-button build action</strong> with procedurally-generated levels and items, in a unique hybrid 2D-3D art style.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tome is an Action RPG with deep character building. Find and craft powerful items. Equip your Tome with a unique combination of gems to forge novel skills to defeat hordes of monsters.",
